---
import { learningNotes } from '@/data/site';
import { withBase } from '@/utils/paths';
---
<section class="section" id="lessons-learned">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading split-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">LESSONS LEARNED</span>
        <h2>틀린 과정도 자산으로 남깁니다.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>결론만 기록하기보다 어떤 가정을 놓쳤고, 무엇을 확인하며 해결했는지 남겨 같은 실수를 줄입니다.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson-grid">
      {learningNotes.map((item) => (
        <a class="lesson-card" href={withBase(item.href)}>
          <span>{item.category}</span>
          <h3>{item.title}</h3>
          <p>{item.lesson}</p>
          <strong>기록 읽기 →</strong>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
